"></p></div><p class=\"imgWithMessage-text-description\"></p></div></section><section class=\"listParrafsWithImg \"><div class=\"scrollAnimation scrollAnimation-left \" style=\"--animation-displacement:120px;--scroll-delay:0ms;--scroll-duration:1000ms\"><div class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-container listParrafsWithImg-item-container0\"><article class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item \"><div class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-text listParrafsWithImg-item-text-oneParraf\"><p class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-text-subTitle\">Escapada corta</p><h2 class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-text-title\">2 días</h2><div class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-text-divider\"></div><div class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-text-article listParrafsWithImg-item-text-article-oneParraf\">Conoce la cultura nativa de Lamas y relájate en la Laguna Azul con paseo en bote y a caballo. Recojo del hotel, guía y almuerzo incluidos. Desde S/ 145 por persona.</div><a class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-text-button buttonPrimary\" href=\"/tours/tarapoto-2dias\">Ver Más</a></div><div class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-images listParrafsWithImg-item-images-oneParraf\"><img class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-images-img listParrafsWithImg-item-images-img-oneParraf\" src=\"/img/imagenesPromociones/2dias/listaPromocion.jpg\" alt=\"2 días\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></article></div></div><div class=\"scrollAnimation scrollAnimation-right \" style=\"--animation-displacement:120px;--scroll-delay:0ms;--scroll-duration:1000ms\"><div class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-container listParrafsWithImg-item-container1\"><article class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item listParrafsWithImg-item-reversed\"><div class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-text listParrafsWithImg-item-text-oneParraf\"><p class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-text-subTitle\">Cultura, lagunas y cascadas</p><h2 class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-text-title\">3 días</h2><div class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-text-divider\"></div><div class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-text-article listParrafsWithImg-item-text-article-oneParraf\">Suma a tu viaje las cataratas de Ahuashiyacu y recorre Lamas, la Laguna Azul y la naturaleza de la Cordillera Escalera con guía y movilidad incluidos. Desde S/ 195 por persona.</div><a class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-text-button buttonPrimary\" href=\"/tours/tarapoto-3dias\">Ver Más</a></div><div class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-images listParrafsWithImg-item-images-oneParraf\"><img class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-images-img listParrafsWithImg-item-images-img-oneParraf\" src=\"/img/imagenesPromociones/3dias/listaPromocion.jpg\" alt=\"3 días\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></article></div></div><div class=\"scrollAnimation scrollAnimation-right \" style=\"--animation-displacement:120px;--scroll-delay:0ms;--scroll-duration:1000ms\"><div class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-container listParrafsWithImg-item-container0\"><article class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item \"><div class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-text listParrafsWithImg-item-text-oneParraf\"><p class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-text-subTitle\">La experiencia completa</p><h2 class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-text-title\">4 días</h2><div class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-text-divider\"></div><div class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-text-article listParrafsWithImg-item-text-article-oneParraf\">Vive todo Tarapoto: Lamas, Laguna Azul, Moyobamba con sus aguas termales y café de altura, y las cataratas de Ahuashiyacu. El recorrido más completo, desde S/ 294 por persona.</div><a class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-text-button buttonPrimary\" href=\"/tours/tarapoto-4dias\">Ver Más</a></div><div class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-images listParrafsWithImg-item-images-oneParraf\"><img class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-images-img listParrafsWithImg-item-images-img-oneParraf\" src=\"/img/imagenesPromociones/4dias/listaPromocion.jpg\" alt=\"4 días\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></article></div></div></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><aside class=\"floatingWhatsapp \"><a href=\"https://wa.me/+51929183224?text=Hola%2C%20me%20encuentro%20interesado%20reservar%20un%20paquete%20con%20ustedes.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"floatingWhatsapp\" aria-label=\"WhatsApp\" title=\"Contáctanos por WhatsApp\"><i class=\"fa fa-brands fa-whatsapp\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a></aside><footer class=\"footer \"><div class=\"footer-firstPart\"><div class=\"footer-firstPart-companyInfo\"><img src=\"/img/imagenesInicio/logoBlanco.webp\" class=\"footer-firstPart-companyInfo-img\"/><p class=\"footer-firstPart-companyInfo-description\">Somos Premium Travel, una agencia de turismo orientada a crear experiencias de viaje memorables, conectando a las personas con nuevos destinos, culturas y momentos únicos.</p><div class=\"footer-firstPart-socials\"><h3 class=\"footer-firstPart-contacts-title\"></h3><ul class=\"footer-firstPart-socials-list\"><li class=\"footer-firstPart-socials-list-item\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/p/Premium-Events-In-The-World-61573880621608/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><i class=\"footer-firstPart-contacts-list-item-icon fa fa-brands fa-facebook\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a></li><li class=\"footer-firstPart-socials-list-item\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/premium.eventsintheworld/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><i class=\"footer-firstPart-contacts-list-item-icon fa fa-brands fa-instagram\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a></li><li class=\"footer-firstPart-socials-list-item\"><a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@premiumevents6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><i class=\"footer-firstPart-contacts-list-item-icon fa fa-brands fa-tiktok\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"footer-firstPart-services\"><h3 class=\"footer-firstPart-services-title\">NUESTROS SERVICIOS</h3><ul class=\"footer-firstPart-services-list\"><li class=\"footer-firstPart-services-list-item\"><p class=\"footer-firstPart-services-list-item-text\">Recojo del Hotel</p></li><li class=\"footer-firstPart-services-list-item\"><p class=\"foote